```
**Root cause:** Double-escaped backslashes (`\\\\(`) in a regex literal match a *literal backslash* `\\(`, not a plain parenthesis `(`. The actual button text is `Gambar ulang (revisi)` — no backslashes. Fixed by using correct single-escape `\\(` inside the regex literal.

**Fix 2 — [`package.json`](file:///srv/sketchbook/Sketchbook-Universe-v2/implementation/package.json)**
```diff
- "@vitejs/plugin-react": "^4.3.4",
  "@vitejs/plugin-react-swc": "^4.3.3",
```
**Root cause:** `@vitejs/plugin-react` (Babel) is never imported in any source file. Only `@vitejs/plugin-react-swc` is used (in `vitest.config.ts`). The Babel package was a redundant artifact.

